attribution: Anonymous traditional singing game from Spain, recorded in Spanish folk-song collections of the 19th century and sung throughout Latin America ever since; melody and words have no known author and are public domain. This is the widespread Latin American text ("de San Nicolás"). Melody checked against the scores and MIDI at Mama Lisa's World.
